# Derived by hand from ruling TC and Semantics ch. 8: `@Count 2` builds its label at 0 and `@Count 1`, whose label is 1 and whose `@Count 0` is 2; the caller's label takes the next number, 3.
test each_level_is_counted

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Label(text="at 2")
    1: Ui.Label(text="at 1")
    2: Ui.Label(text="zero")
    3: Ui.Label(text="after")
